    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle {\begin{array}{c}X=2\lambda ap,\ \ Y=2\lambda bq,\ \ Z=2\lambda cr,\\Xp+Yq+Zr=0.\end{array}}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/6a97a833b7023cf5407e0c6e4cc1e4cf44a74648" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -2.505ex; width:34.593ex; height:6.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle {\begin{array}{c}X=2\lambda ap,\ \ Y=2\lambda bq,\ \ Z=2\lambda cr,\\Xp+Yq+Zr=0.\end{array}}}"/></span></dd></dl>
<p id="mwWA">The first three equations are easily solved for <span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;" about="#mwt42" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwWQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"mvar","href":"./Template:Mvar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"p"}},"i":0}}]}'>p</span>, <span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;" about="#mwt43" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwWg" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"mvar","href":"./Template:Mvar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"q"}},"i":0}}]}'>q</span>, <span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;" about="#mwt44" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwWw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"mvar","href":"./Template:Mvar"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"r"}},"i":0}}]}'>r</span>, and substituting in the last equation produces</p>
<dl id="mwXA"><dd id="mwXQ"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt45" id="mwXg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\frac{X^2}{2\\lambda a}+\\frac{Y^2}{2\\lambda b}+\\frac{Z^2}{2\\lambda c}=0."}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle {\frac {X^{2}}{2\lambda a}}+{\frac {Y^{2}}{2\lambda b}}+{\frac {Z^{2}}{2\lambda c}}=0.}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
          <mfrac>
            <msup>
              <mi>X</mi>
              <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                <mn>2</mn>
              </mrow>
            </msup>
            <mrow>
              <mn>2</mn>
              <mi>λ<!-- λ --></mi>
              <mi>a</mi>
            </mrow>
          </mfrac>
        </mrow>
        <mo>+</mo>
        <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
          <mfrac>
            <msup>
              <mi>Y</mi>
              <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                <mn>2</mn>
              </mrow>
            </msup>
            <mrow>
              <mn>2</mn>
              <mi>λ<!-- λ --></mi>
              <mi>b</mi>
